        <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>面对久坐，青年们已经在主动找办法。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>只是现有办法都靠自觉，坚持不下来。</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(79,224,176,0.4)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px'}}>
